<h3>The One Question That Decides Everything</h3>

<p>If you can only ask one question to decide between SEO and PPC, ask this:</p>

<p><em>"Can I afford to wait 6 months for leads, or do I need revenue this month?"</em></p>

<p>If you need revenue this month, choose PPC. If you can wait 6 months, choose SEO. If you need both, choose the hybrid approach.</p>

<p>The contractors who build the most valuable businesses choose the hybrid approach. They use PPC to survive today and SEO to thrive tomorrow.</p>

